OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMostly cloudy and rather warm
OL,6,FThursday, with the chance of a few
OL,7,Fsunny spells developing later in the
OL,8,Fafternoon. Remaining dry throughout,
OL,9,Fwith winds generally light.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FOvernight cloudy with a band
OL,12,Fof rain, heavy at times moving in,
OL,13,Fsinking slowly southeastwards through
OL,14,Fthe region by dawn. Winds gradually
OL,15,Feasing overnight.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FA mild and wet start, skies
OL,18,Fslowly clearing from the north from
OL,19,Flate morning. Chance of some showers
OL,20,Fdeveloping during the afternoon along
OL,21,Fthe Kent coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
