OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCooler
OL,6,Fthrough this period, with sunny spells
OL,7,Fand isolated showers. Showers become
OL,8,Fmore frequent and heavier on Monday.
OL,9,FWinds mostly light, but breezy at
OL,10,Ftimes near coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
